<title>USA: Quality Dining CFO Sosinski resigns.</title>
<headline>Quality Dining CFO Sosinski resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MISHAWAKA, Ind. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quality Dining Inc said on Monday that Michael Sosinski resigned as chief financial officer, effective November 1.</p>
<p>It said David Findlay, formerly vice president-director of planning and investor relations, will advance to the position of treasurer and assume Sosinski's primary reporting responsibilities.</p>
<p>Quality Dining operates and franchises 558 quick-service and casual theme restaurants.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
